=== layout: prompt

# Icebreaker

@prompt

[Which animal would make the worst roommate, and why?]{color=#D40000}

@examples

State your name, major, and post-grad plans.

- Think about noise, food, space, or daily habits.
- Examples: a woodpecker at sunrise, or an octopus opening every cupboard.
- Give your animal and one reason. No biology expertise needed!

