=== layout: movie-panel

# *The Animal Kingdom (2023)*

@body

- In a world hit by a wave of mutations transforming humans into animals, Fran&#231;ois does everything he can to save his wife. As some of the creatures disappear into a nearby forest, he and their son &#201;mile embark on a quest that will change their lives forever.
  - IMDb&#160;{=*6.7*=},&#160;13k&#160;votes | Metacritic\:&#160;&#129001;&#160;69
  - RT&#160;critics\:&#160;&#127813;&#127942;&#160;83% | RT&#160;audience\:&#160;&#127871;&#160;76%
- Genre\: Adventure, Drama, Science Fiction
- Director\: Thomas Cailley
- Run time\: 127 min
- Original language\: French
- Review Summary\: The Animal Kingdom's talented cast anchors its more fantastical elements in human emotion, helping offset a superficial treatment of thought-provoking themes.

@poster

![The Animal Kingdom (2023) movie poster](assets/the_animal_kingdom_2023/poster.webp)

=== layout: two-panels

# The Animal Kingdom (2023): Content Advisory

@left

## IMDb Parents Guide

{table-style=comparison}
| Content | Rating |
| --- | --- |
| Sex & Nudity | [*Mild*]{color=#007A00} |
| Violence & Gore | [*Moderate*]{color=#B74300} |
| Profanity | [*Mild*]{color=#007A00} |
| Alcohol, Drugs & Smoking | [*Mild*]{color=#007A00} |
| Frightening & Intense Scenes | [*Moderate*]{color=#B74300} |

@right

## What to expect

- Two characters kiss and undress each other.
- A claw is torn off; stitches are pulled from skin; some blood is shown or licked.
- A character's bird mutation and attempted surgery involve blood and scars.
- A character is shot; a wound is briefly shown without blood.
- Tobacco use.

@citation

Source: IMDb Parents Guide (user-contributed ratings).

